    <panel_attributes>title=SD12 Restore course progress and history
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=CourseService~c
obj=ProgressRestorer~x
obj=Saved course / quiz / plan repositories~s
obj=ProgressTracker~t
obj=HistoryRecorder~h

u-&gt;f : getProgress(courseId) or getHistory(courseId)
f-&gt;c : getCourse(courseId)
c.&gt;f : saved Course
f-&gt;x : restore(course)
x-&gt;s : listAttempts and listPlans for the selected course
s.&gt;x : saved submitted results and tasks
x: rebuildSummary using GRADED results, review events and done task IDs
x-&gt;t : restoreSummary(rebuilt summary)
x-&gt;h : restore missing events or labelled snapshots
t.&gt;u : restored selected-course counts
h.&gt;u : available history and storage notices
x:Back up damaged derived files, preserve unreadable source records and existing counts
x:Recovered snapshots cannot reconstruct lost grading transitions or unavailable timestamps</panel_attributes>
